      {
        "id": 85749,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-15T05:35:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The comic was as good as it really needed to be given that it was a free stretch reward done to show appreciation to the fans for donating so much. If they ever did do a serious publication run or a full story arc though, I would probably be much more judgemental and demand more of the content.</p>",
