        "created_at": "2014-01-15T15:12:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If they&nbsp;do start doing comics more often&nbsp;they may even need to hire another artist or so, ones that could mimic Adam's art style. There's already 1 person on BGG making custom decks that seems similar to his&nbsp;art style.</p>",
